n  Operating income | 10503 | 10851 | 11095 | 12140 | 44589 |  | 13391 | 13873 | 13753 | 15955 | 56972\nMore Personal Computing | Q1-25 | Q2-25 | Q3-25 | Q4-25 | Fiscal Year 2025 |  | Q1-26 | Q2-26 | Q3-26 | Q4-26 | Fiscal Year 2026\nRevenue | 13176 | 14651 | 13371 | 1"
