    "content": "[metrics.txt 第 0–2266 字符，共 2266]\n\n### 工作表: Metrics\n | Investor Metrics\n | (in billions, except for percentages) |  | Q4'25 | FY25 | Q1'26 | Q2'26 | Q3'26 | Q4'26 | FY26\n | Commercial (Includes commercial portion of LinkedIn)\n |  | Commercial bookings growth (y/y)* | 37% / 30% | 0.38 | 112% / 111% | 230% / 228% | -4% / -6% | 10% / 11% | 0.8300000000000001\n |  | Commercial remaining performance obligation | 368 | 368 | 392 | 625 | 627 | 678 | 678\n |  | Microsoft Cloud revenue | 46.7 | 168.9 | 49.1 | 51.5 | 54.5 | 59.3 | 214.4\n |  | Microsoft Cloud revenue growth (y/y)* | 27% / 25% | 23% / 23% | 26% / 25% | 26% / 24% | 29% / 25% | 27% / 27% | 27% / 25%\n |  | Microsoft Cloud gross margin percentage | 0.68 | 0.6900000000000001 | 0.68 | 0.67 | 0.66 | 0.65 | 0.66\n | Productivity & Business Processes and Intelligent Cloud\n |  | Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud revenue growth (y/y)* | 18% / 16% | 15% / 15% | 17% / 15% | 17% / 14% | 19% / 15% | 14% / 14% | 17% / 14%\n |  | Microsoft 365 Commercial seat growth (y/y) | 0.06 | 0.06 | 0.06 | 0.06 | 0.06 | 0.06 | 0.06\n |  | Microsoft 365 Consumer cloud revenue growth (y/y)* | 20% / 20% | 11% / 12% | 26% / 25% | 29% / 27% | 33% / 29% | 24% / 22% | 28% / 26%\n |  | LinkedIn revenue growth (y/y)* | 9% / 8% | 9% / 9% | 10%/ 9% | 11% / 10% | 12% / 9% | 12% / 10% | 11% / 9%\n |  | Dynamics 365 revenue growth (y/y)* | 23% / 21% | 19% / 19% | 18% / 16% | 19% / 17% | 22% / 17% | 13% / 12% | 18% / 15%\n |  | Azure and other cloud services revenue growth (y/y)* | 39% / 39% | 34% / 35% | 40% / 39% | 39% / 38% | 40% / 39% | 43% / 43% | 41% / 40%\n | More Personal Computing\n |  | Windows OEM and Devices revenue growth (y/y)* | 3% / 3% | 3% / 3% | 6% / 6% | 1% / 0% | -2% / -3% | -7% / -7% | -1% / -1%\n |  | XBOX content and services revenue growth (y/y)* | 13% / 12% | 16% / 16% | 1% / 0% | -5% / -6% | -5% / -7% | -10% / -10% | -5% / -6%\n |  | Search advertising revenue (ex TAC) growth (y/y)* | 21% / 20% | 20% / 21% | 16% / 15% | 10% / 9% | 12% / 9% | 10% / 9% | 12% / 10%\n |  | * Includes non-GAAP constant currency growth (GAAP% / Constant Currency%)\n |  | Certain amounts have been rounded for presentation purposes\n |  | Reconciliation of GAAP and non-GAAP financial measures are available in the Earnings Release Slides (http://aka.ms/slidesfy26q4)"
